Third-party data and models used by RoadLedger.
Neither is redistributed in this repository; both are fetched by script.
* RDD2022 road damage dataset - CC BY 4.0. Fetched by scripts/fetch_rdd2022.py.
  Arya et al., "RDD2022: A multi-national image dataset for automatic road
  damage detection", Geoscience Data Journal 11(4), 2024.
* YuNet face detector - OpenCV Zoo, Apache 2.0. Fetched by
  scripts/fetch_models.sh.
